{
  "sn24.96:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 24.96 ",
  "sn24.96:0.2": "4. Catutthagamanavagga ",
  "sn24.96:0.3": "Adukkhamasukhīsutta ",
  "sn24.96:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn24.96:1.2": "“Kismiṁ nu kho, bhikkhave, sati, kiṁ upādāya, kiṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.96:1.3": "‘adukkhamasukhī attā hoti arogo paraṁ maraṇā’”ti? ",
  "sn24.96:1.4": "“Bhagavaṁmūlakā no, bhante, dhammā …pe…. ",
  "sn24.96:2.1": "“Rūpe kho, bhikkhave, sati, rūpaṁ upādāya, rūpaṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.96:2.2": "‘adukkhamasukhī attā hoti arogo paraṁ maraṇā’ti. ",
  "sn24.96:2.3": "Vedanāya sati … ",
  "sn24.96:2.4": "saññāya sati … ",
  "sn24.96:2.5": "saṅkhāresu sati … ",
  "sn24.96:2.6": "viññāṇe sati, viññāṇaṁ upādāya, viññāṇaṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.96:2.7": "‘adukkhamasukhī attā hoti arogo paraṁ maraṇā’ti. ",
  "sn24.96:3.1": "Taṁ kiṁ maññatha, bhikkhave, ",
  "sn24.96:3.2": "rūpaṁ niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn24.96:3.3": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn24.96:3.4": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vā taṁ sukhaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn24.96:3.5": "“Dukkhaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn24.96:3.6": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vipariṇāmadhammaṁ, kallaṁ nu taṁ samanupassituṁ: ",
  "sn24.96:3.7": "‘etaṁ mama, esohamasmi, eso me attā’”ti? ",
  "sn24.96:3.8": "“No hetaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn24.96:3.9": "“V